abstract: "Software-in-the-Loop simulation of a legacy CNC spindle with an edge fault detector (shock, variance, drift), MQTT transport, Node-RED, InfluxDB and Grafana, used for the verification in a diploma thesis on non-invasive machine monitoring for Serbian SMEs."
